            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Launchpad 0.3.10</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Search caret uses the semantic primary color, so it stays white in both the empty and typing states on the dark launcher.</li>
  <li>While typing, the settings ellipsis is replaced by the clear button; clearing restores the ellipsis and hides the clear button.</li>
  <li>The settings popover closes as soon as search input begins.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
